[SIZE=4][B]📌 Maintainer & Release Notice[/B][/SIZE]
[QUOTE]
Because there is an active official maintainer for Android 16 Evolution X ([B]Giovanni / TechPanelGM[/B]), this build is [B]not and will never be an official Evolution X build[/B]. 

I am hosting and maintaining this [B]Android 17 (cnb)[/B] build as the [B]Unofficial Maintainer[/B] for the Pixel 8 Pro community, ensuring full upstream source parity with Evolution X's Android 17 codebase, latest security patches, and Tensor G3 hardware optimizations.
[/QUOTE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=4][B]✨ What's New & Upstream `cnb` Parity[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Upstream Evolution X 12.3 Parity:[/B] Synced with the latest Evolution X Android 17 [ICODE]cnb[/ICODE] sources.
[*][B]Google Photos Tensor G3 Detection:[/B] Fixed Google Photos Tensor platform identification for Photo Unblur, Magic Eraser, and Ultra HDR processing.
[*][B]Play Integrity Hardening:[/B] Built-in PIF framework updates ensuring passing Play Integrity (MEETS_DEVICE_INTEGRITY) and CTS out-of-the-box.
[*][B]Quick Settings Security:[/B] Sensitive QS tiles (Mobile Data, Wi-Fi, Hotspot) require authentication when locked.
[*][B]Pixel-Style Framework Overlays:[/B] Integrated Pixel overlay configurations, default permissions, and AppDataBackup compatibility.
[*][B]Firmware Requirement:[/B] Built for and packaged against stock [B]CP3A.261005.005[/B] (October 2026) firmware (ripcurrent bootloader & modem).
[/LIST]

