[SIZE=4][B]📖 Installation Instructions[/B][/SIZE]

[B]First Time Install / Clean Flash (Coming from Stock or Another Custom ROM):[/B]
[CODE]
1. Verify device firmware is on CP3A.261005.005 (October 2026).
2. Reboot into bootloader:
   adb reboot bootloader
3. Flash the recovery images:
   fastboot flash boot boot.img
   fastboot flash vendor_boot vendor_boot.img
4. Reboot to Recovery:
   fastboot reboot recovery
5. In Recovery: select "Factory Reset" -> "Format data/factory reset".
6. Select "Apply update" -> "Apply from ADB":
   adb sideload EvolutionX-17.0-20261016-husky-12.3-Unofficial.zip
7. Reboot system!
[/CODE]

[B]Dirty Flash / Updating from Previous Unofficial Build:[/B]
[CODE]
1. Reboot to Recovery.
2. Select "Apply update" -> "Apply from ADB":
   adb sideload EvolutionX-17.0-20261016-husky-12.3-Unofficial.zip
3. (Optional) Re-install Magisk / KernelSU if previously rooted.
4. Reboot system. (No data wipe required).
[/CODE]

